  <p>9.2 If you send ideas or feedback, we may use it without payment or attribution to improve the Service, provided we do not disclose your Business Data as part of doing so.</p>
  <h2>10. Third-party services</h2>
  <p>The Service works alongside third parties, including: device makers; internet providers; MoMo providers and banks (for money the Business collects itself); app stores; the hosting provider (MonsterASP.NET, in Europe); NeedleBase's licensing service, for licence-key checks; <strong>Gmail SMTP</strong> or <strong>Resend</strong>, which we use to send email (password-reset and optional staff-invite messages); and <strong>Meta</strong> (WhatsApp Cloud API) when a Business turns on WhatsApp order notices and a customer has opted in — in that case the customer's number and the notice can be processed by Meta under Meta's own terms. The public website may also offer a WhatsApp "click to chat" link so you can message us; that is a link you choose to open.</p>
  <p>We are not responsible for those third parties' services, charges, outages or terms. Links or references do not imply endorsement.</p>
