  <p>11.2 Subject to clause 11.1, neither party is liable for indirect or consequential loss, loss of profit, loss of goodwill, or loss caused by incorrect Business Data, a lost device, failure to sync, or a third-party payment failure. Each Business should verify measurements, orders and payments before relying on them.</p>
