  <p>12.2 The current product has <strong>no in-app or self-service button</strong> to export or delete a whole shop account. An Owner (or a staff member, about their own sign-in account) may ask us by email or WhatsApp to delete the account and the associated data we hold. After we have verified the request, we will normally action it within 30 days, except where the law requires or allows us to keep something, or the data is reasonably needed to resolve a dispute or enforce these Terms.</p>
  <p>12.3 If a Business simply stops using the Service without asking us to delete the account, we keep the Business Data we hold on the hosted service for <strong>one year</strong> after use stops, and then we delete it, except where the law requires or allows us to keep something. The server <strong>audit log</strong> is deleted after <strong>730 days</strong> (two years) by default, which is a separate period and may run longer or shorter than the one-year shop-data period. Data stored only on a Business's own device remains the Business's responsibility.</p>
  <p>12.4 On a verified written request from the Owner we will also, within a reasonable period (normally within 30 days), make Business Data held in our systems available in a reasonable manner, except where the law does not allow that. We do not promise a particular export format. Act 772, section 8 addresses retention of electronic records where a law requires retention.</p>
  <p>12.5 Clauses that by their nature should survive termination (ownership, data protection, liability, governing law) survive.</p>
